---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const headshotUrl = "/eric%202026%20headshot.png";

const principles = [
  { title: "Understand the work", body: "Start with how a request, opportunity, or job moves through the business. Find the missing context and unclear ownership before choosing the tools." },
  { title: "Make the next step clear", body: "Give operators an explicit owner, a useful view of the evidence, and a clear action. Make review points part of the workflow." },
  { title: "Stay through rollout", body: "Build in increments, document the process, and stay close to the people using it. Adoption and day-to-day support are part of the work." },
  { title: "Keep decisions grounded", body: "Tie technical choices back to growth, delivery, and visibility. Favor systems the team can understand, maintain, and use repeatedly." }
];
---

<Base title="About Eric Martin" description="Meet Eric Martin, a systems builder whose background connects commercial ownership, national field operations, and hands-on software engineering.">
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="page-container-mid">
      <div class="grid items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-12">
        <img
          src={headshotUrl}
          alt="Eric Martin"
          width="400"
          height="500"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[240px] rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel object-cover shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.1)]"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">About Eric Martin</p>
          <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">An operator who builds.</h1>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
            My work sits where business development, field and service operations,
            and software meet. I am drawn to the places where the problem is clear,
            but the process and tools around it still need to be built.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
            That has meant closing new work while building CRM and pipeline systems,
            helping scale national field delivery, and creating applications that
            connect research, projects, finance, and operations. I take ownership of
            both how the work should move and how the software makes that possible.
          </p>
          <a class="focus-ring mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-dark" href="/resume">View my experience <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mt-14" aria-labelledby="background-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">The background behind the builds</p>
        <h2 id="background-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Experience across the whole workflow.</h2>
        <div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="surface flex flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Field operations</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">At Vale Field Services, I built processes, vendor networks, training, QA, and delivery infrastructure for distributed teams and national programs.</p>
            <a class="focus-ring mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-dark" href="/resume">Professional experience <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="surface flex flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Commercial systems</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">At Kansas Electric, I combined business development with hands-on tooling for lead capture, CRM, estimating, field reports, and forecasting.</p>
            <a class="focus-ring mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-dark" href="/work/kansas-electric">Kansas Electric case study <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="surface flex flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Connected software</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Through Atlas-Beren Systems, I have brought those concerns into a shared platform for prospect research, delivery, cash planning, and service work.</p>
            <a class="focus-ring mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-dark" href="/abs-tooling">Inside ABS Tooling <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="surface-muted mt-12 p-6 sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">How I work</p>
        <h2 id="approach-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Clarity, ownership, and follow-through.</h2>
        <div class="mt-7 grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {principles.map((principle) => (
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">{principle.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{principle.body}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 border-t border-border pt-10 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Outside of work</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">I share life with my fiancée, our son, two dogs, a cat, and a ferret. I spend my time making and playing music, running, and being with my family.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Where I fit</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">I work best with teams that need someone who can understand commercial goals, field reality, and software architecture together—and carry a solution through implementation.</p>
          <a class="focus-ring mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-dark" href="/contact">Start a conversation <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
